ounty"],["ARC or PLC in Brown County","/arc-plc/nebraska/brown-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Brown County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 years and April to May in 29. In 2025, on the middle of the grids, May to June ran 135% of normal and November to December just 34%. Grid 27121 had its driest year in 1989 at 47% of normal.</p>"}
